# Placeholder Images Directory

This directory contains placeholder images for the parallax effect.
Replace these with your actual image assets:

- parallax-bg.png - Furthest background layer (slowest movement, 0.2x scroll speed)
- parallax-mid.png - Middle depth layer (0.5x scroll speed)
- parallax-foreground.png - Closest layer (0.8x scroll speed)
- hero-device.png - Optional central focal object
- grid.png - Subtle grid overlay
- noise.png - Grain texture (low opacity)

All images should be optimized for web (PNG or WebP format recommended).
